	(text_box "Notes\n---\n\n- Tnfeeon's battery eliminator circuit (BEC) keeps U_{Servo} at 5.8V\n- ESC has preattached capacitors against voltage ripple (no idea how much C, enough I hope)\n- Jetson Orin NX gets stabilized 5V-6.1V (P-Channel Mosfet, standard automotive with schottky rectifier)\n- hunting down Jeff Bezos for datasheets rn"
